<title>INDONESIA: Inco announces 5 cts/share final div.</title>
<headline>Inco announces 5 cts/share final div.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT International Nickel Indonesia (INCO) said on Tuesday its shareholders had approved a final 1996 dividend of 5.0 U.S. cents per share.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the dividend was payable on June 4 to shareholders on record as of May 6.</p>
<p>&quot;When combined with the interim dividend of five cents per share, paid by the company on December 12, the aggregate dividend in respect of 1996 is 10 cents per share, the same level as 1995,&quot; the company said.</p>
</text>
